#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0112-A expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "ARELTM is not declared, so Requirements.Variables.All [ARELTM, ARELTMU] gates the rule to SKIPPED naming the absent variable. The gate is load-bearing on THIS half: its Check is empty(ARELTM) with a populated ARELTMU, which on an absent ARELTM column would fire on both rows (absent = all-missing). Mirror of the parent's skipped_no_areltmu fixture - the two halves pin the two one-absent states between them."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col ARELTMU type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 2.5 | HOURS
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALT | 7.0 | HOURS
